# English-Only Developer Comments

- Write new and edited source comments, docstrings, SQL comments, and developer annotations in English. Explain non-obvious intent and constraints.
- Use the project's localization system for user-facing copy. See [Design system](mandatory-design.mdc).
- Follow [Git commits](git-commits.mdc) when writing commit messages.
